%% Ciclo de vida de un modelo ML (F7, docs/models/05)
flowchart TD
    DS[Dataset<br/>id + version + checksum] --> VAL[Dataset Validation]
    VAL --> PRE[Preprocessing<br/>preprocessing_version]
    PRE --> FE[Feature Engineering<br/>feature_schema_version]
    FE --> SPLIT[Split versionado<br/>held-out INTOCABLE]
    SPLIT --> TR[Training<br/>TrainingRun: config+seed+git+hardware]
    TR --> V[Validation<br/>barrido de hiperparámetros SOLO aquí]
    V --> T[Test<br/>protocolo pre-registrado ADR-0011]
    T --> EXP[Export ONNX<br/>paridad exacta verificada]
    EXP --> MAN[Model Manifest<br/>checksum + runtime + umbral]
    MAN --> REG[(Model Registry<br/>estado + capacidades)]
    REG --> EDGEV{Validación edge<br/>latencia · RAM · ARM64 · estabilidad}
    EDGEV -->|aprobada| EA[EDGE_APPROVED → DEPLOYED<br/>diagnostic-agent]
    EDGEV -->|falla| REG
